# Smoke test: Level Builder phase 4 select-tile flow
# Enter Development mode, navigate Move Mode, switch to Select Tile Mode, move the selection, then return to play.
wait startup
wait 250

press ENTER
wait 150

keydown D
wait 350
keydown W
wait 350
keyup W
wait 150
keydown S
wait 250
keyup S
keyup D
wait 200

press E
wait 180

press D
wait 120
press D
wait 120
press W
wait 120
press A
wait 120

press Q
wait 120

press ENTER
wait 150

keydown D
wait 1100
press SPACE
wait 900
keyup D
wait 250

press R
wait 250

exit